				<ownedComment xmi:type='uml:Comment' xmi:id='_19_0_2_26f0132_1562309031520_417028_142910' body='a derived relationship among SAF_Concepts which is important for views and stakeholders, but not  a primary information&#10;The rule of derivation must be specified and is used if the relationship is exposed in a view.&#10;This shall be always used together with SAF_Concept on relationships.&#10;Used for specifying SAF.'>
